#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca_cov.rst:2
msgid "pca\\_cov"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:1
msgid "Compute principal components on the given covariance matrix ``cov``."
msgstr "与えられた共分散行列 ``cov`` に対して主成分を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:3
msgid ""
"This function extracts principal components directly from a covariance "
"matrix via singular value decomposition, which is useful when the "
"covariance matrix is already available (e.g., computed with :func:`covar`"
" or estimated by other means).  The components are returned in descending"
" order of explained variance.  Specifically, ``components[*, i, :]`` "
"represents the :math:`(i+1)`-th largest principal component of the batch "
"specified by ``*``."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、特異値分解によって共分散行列から直接主成分を抽出します。共分散行列が既に手元にある場合（例えば :func:`covar` "
"で計算済みの場合や、他の方法で推定した場合）に有用です。主成分は説明分散の降順で返されます。具体的には、``components[*, i, "
":]`` は ``*`` で指定されるバッチの :math:`(i+1)` 番目に大きい主成分を表します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca_cov.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:12
msgid "The input tensor containing symmetric covariance matrices."
msgstr "対称な共分散行列を含む入力テンソル。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca_cov.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:15
msgid ""
"A dataclass containing:      - ``components`` (Tensor): Principal "
"components (eigenvectors of       the covariance matrix) of shape "
":math:`(*, D, D)`.       ``components[..., i, j]`` represents the "
":math:`i`-th       component's weight for the :math:`j`-th dimension."
"     - ``explained_variance`` (Tensor): The variance explained by each"
"       component (eigenvalues of the covariance matrix) of shape       "
":math:`(*, D)`, in descending order."
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:17
msgid "A dataclass containing:"
msgstr "以下を含むデータクラス:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:19
msgid ""
"``components`` (Tensor): Principal components (eigenvectors of the "
"covariance matrix) of shape :math:`(*, D, D)`. ``components[..., i, j]`` "
"represents the :math:`i`-th component's weight for the :math:`j`-th "
"dimension."
msgstr ""
"``components`` (Tensor): 形状 :math:`(*, D, D)` "
"の主成分（共分散行列の固有ベクトル）。``components[..., i, j]`` は第 :math:`i` 成分の第 :math:`j` "
"次元に対する重みを表します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:23
msgid ""
"``explained_variance`` (Tensor): The variance explained by each component"
" (eigenvalues of the covariance matrix) of shape :math:`(*, D)`, in "
"descending order."
msgstr ""
"``explained_variance`` (Tensor): 形状 :math:`(*, D)` "
"の、各成分によって説明される分散（共分散行列の固有値）。降順に並びます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca_cov.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:28
msgid "Shape:"
msgstr "形状:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:29
msgid ""
"cov: :math:`(*, D, D)` where ``*`` means any number of additional "
"dimensions, and ``D`` means the number of dimensions."
msgstr "cov: :math:`(*, D, D)`。``*`` は任意の数の追加次元を、``D`` は次元数を表します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:33
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:35
msgid ""
">>> cov = torch.tensor([[2.0, 0.0],\n"
"...                     [0.0, 1.0]])\n"
">>> result = QF.pca_cov(cov)\n"
">>> result.components\n"
"tensor([[1., 0.],\n"
"        [0., 1.]])\n"
">>> result.explained_variance\n"
"tensor([2., 1.])"
msgstr ""
">>> cov = torch.tensor([[2.0, 0.0],\n"
"...                     [0.0, 1.0]])\n"
">>> result = QF.pca_cov(cov)\n"
">>> result.components\n"
"tensor([[1., 0.],\n"
"        [0., 1.]])\n"
">>> result.explained_variance\n"
"tensor([2., 1.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:44
msgid ""
"The sign of each principal component is arbitrary: components are defined"
" only up to sign, so an equivalent input may yield components multiplied "
"by -1."
msgstr "各主成分の符号は任意です。主成分は符号を除いてのみ定義されるため、等価な入力に対して -1 倍された主成分が返されることがあります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:49
msgid ":func:`pca`: PCA computed directly from data."
msgstr ":func:`pca`: データから直接計算する PCA。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca_cov:50
msgid ":func:`nanpca`: NaN-aware principal component analysis."
msgstr ":func:`nanpca`: NaN を考慮した主成分分析。"

